WEBVTT

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:00.901
For decades,

00:03:00.925 --> 00:03:04.966
many workplaces expected people
to leave parts of themselves at home.

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:07.911
"Don't show your anxiety
in a performance review."

00:03:07.935 --> 00:03:10.999
"Don't tell your boss what
you really think of her idea."

00:03:11.023 --> 00:03:13.104
"And don't wear a Hawaiian shirt

00:03:13.128 --> 00:03:15.047
unless it's Hawaiian Shirt Friday."

00:03:16.073 --> 00:03:17.236
But today,

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:19.737
in part, thanks to the popularity
of self-expression

00:03:19.761 --> 00:03:21.120
in Silicon Valley companies,

00:03:21.144 --> 00:03:23.766
there's a growing awareness
that people need the freedom

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:25.361
to be themselves at work,

00:03:25.385 --> 00:03:26.943
to be authentic.

00:03:26.967 --> 00:03:29.009
(Music)

00:03:29.033 --> 00:03:31.409
Recorded speaker 1:
I'm going to talk a little bit